20" class="infobox-padding"></td></tr><tr><th colspan="20" class="infobox-subheader">Values</th></tr><tr><td colspan="20" class="infobox-padding"></td></tr><tr><th colspan="7"><a href="/w/Value" title="Value">Value</a></th><td colspan="13">20 coins</td></tr><tr><th colspan="7"><a href="/w/High_Level_Alchemy" title="High Level Alchemy">High alch</a></th><td colspan="13">12 coins</td></tr><tr><th colspan="7"><a href="/w/Low_Level_Alchemy" title="Low Level Alchemy">Low alch</a></th><td colspan="13">8 coins</td></tr><tr><th colspan="7"><a href="/w/Weight" title="Weight">Weight</a></th><td colspan="13">0.255 kg</td></tr><tr><th colspan="7"><a href="/w/Item_respawns" class="mw-redirect" title="Item respawns">Respawn time</a></th><td colspan="13">100 ticks (60 seconds)</td></tr><tr><td colspan="20" class="infobox-padding"></td></tr><tr><th colspan="20" class="infobox-subheader">Grand Exchange</th></tr><tr><td colspan="20" class="infobox-padding"></td></tr><tr><th colspan="7"><a href="/w/RuneScape:Grand_Exchange_Market_Watch" title="RuneScape:Grand Exchange Market Watch">Exchange</a></th><td colspan="13"><span class="infobox-quantity" data-val-each="152"><span class="infobox-quantity-replace">152</span> coins (<a href="/w/Exchange:Lobster_pot" title="Exchange:Lobster pot">info</a>)</span></td></tr><tr><th colspan="7"><a href="/w/Grand_Exchange#Buy_limits" title="Grand Exchange">Buy limit</a></th><td colspan="13">40</td></tr><tr><th colspan="7"><a href="/w/Grand_Exchange#Volume" title="Grand Exchange">Daily volume</a></th><td colspan="13">4,444</td></tr><tr><td colspan="20" class="infobox-padding"></td></tr><tr><td colspan="20" class="infobox-full-width-content"><div class="realtime-prices plainlinks"><a target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" class="external text" href="https://prices.runescape.wiki/osrs/item/301"><span class="cdx-button realtime-ge-openbtn" style="font-size:inherit;min-height:0;padding:3px 12px">View real-time prices</span></a></div></td></tr><tr><td colspan="20" class="infobox-padding"></td></tr><tr><td colspan="20" class="infobox-full-width-content"><div class="GEChartBox"><div class="GEChartItems" style="display:none"></div><div class="GEdatachart smallChart" style="height:160px;margin:0 auto;width:258px"><div style="user-select:none;opacity:.75;text-align:center;font-size:.9em">Loading...</div></div><div class="GEdataprices" data-item="Lobster pot" data-itemid="301" data-limit="40" data-value="20" style="display:none"></div></div></td></tr><tr><td colspan="20" class="infobox-padding"></td></tr><tr class="advanced-data"><th colspan="20" class="infobox-subheader">Advanced data</th></tr><tr class="advanced-data"><td colspan="20" class="infobox-padding"></td></tr><tr class="advanced-data"><th colspan="7">Item ID</th><td colspan="13">301</td></tr><tr class="advanced-data"><th colspan="7">Link</th><td colspan="13"><a target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" class="external text" href="https://chisel.weirdgloop.org/moid/item_id.html#301">MOID</a></td></tr><tr class="advanced-data"><td colspan="20" class="infobox-padding"></td></tr></tbody></table>
<figure class="mw-halign-left" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/w/File:Lobster_pot_detail.png" class="mw-file-description"><img src="/images/thumb/Lobster_pot_detail.png/160px-Lobster_pot_detail.png?a6765" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="160" height="154" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/images/thumb/Lobster_pot_detail.png/320px-Lobster_pot_detail.png?a6765 2x" data-file-width="1373" data-file-height="1323" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>
<p><b>Lobster pots</b> are <a href="/w/Items" title="Items">items</a> that can be bought from major <a href="/w/Fishing_shops" title="Fishing shops">fishing shops</a> for 20 <a href="/w/Coins" title="Coins">coins</a> each and are used to <a href="/w/Fishing" title="Fishing">fish</a> <a href="/w/Raw_lobster" title="Raw lobster">lobsters</a> from <a href="/w/Fishing_spot_(cage,_harpoon)" title="Fishing spot (cage, harpoon)">cage/harpoon</a> <a href="/w/Fishing_spot" class="mw-redirect" title="Fishing spot">fishing spots</a> with 40 Fishing, which are a common healing <a href="/w/Food" title="Food">food</a> that restores 12 <a href="/w/Hitpoints" title="Hitpoints">Hitpoints</a>. A lobster pot <a href="/w/Spawning" title="Spawning">spawn</a> is found within the <a href="/w/Fishing_Guild" title="Fishing Guild">Fishing Guild</a>. 
</p><p>They are also used in <a href="/w/Raw_dark_crab" title="Raw dark crab">dark crab</a> fishing. <a href="/w/Fishing_spot_(dark_crab)" title="Fishing spot (dark crab)">Dark crab fishing spots</a> are only in the <a href="/w/Wilderness" title="Wilderness">Wilderness</a> and require level 85 fishing,
</p>
