<td data-sort-value="21 October 2020"><a href="/w/21_October" title="21 October">21&#160;October</a>&#160;<a href="/w/2020" title="2020">2020</a><br />(<a href="/w/Update:Halloween_2020" title="Update:Halloween 2020">Update</a>)
</td>
<td>
<p>The item's name was changed from "Lobster cage" back to "Lobster pot".
</p>
</td></tr>
<tr>
